<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola FEMSA raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola FEMSA raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Kleinwort Benson said on Monday it had raised its rating on Coca-Cola FEMSA S.A. to buy from hold and set a year-end price target of $30.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Enrique Klix said, &quot;Operationally, the company did very well. I'm happy with the way they are managing the business.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He wrote in a report that FEMSA's major improvement came in Argentina, with increased consumption and a better economic climate.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock was up 5/8 to 25-3/8 in early trade in New York.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
